OL,3,GNEWSAMurder probe after man stabbed at
OL,4,ABrent Council HQ
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation is continuing
OL,7,Fafter a young man was stabbed in a
OL,8,Fbuilding housing Brent Council's
OL,9,Fheadquarters and a library.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called at about
OL,12,F14:30 BST on Tuesday to Brent Civic
OL,13,FCentre, near Wembley Stadium in
OL,14,Fnorth-west London, where the victim,
OL,15,Fbelieved to be a teenage boy or man in
OL,16,Fhis early 20s, was pronounced dead at
OL,17,Fthe scene.
OL,19,FWhile some Brent residents described
OL,20,Fthe attack as a shock, others said the
OL,21,Fstabbing "was not a big surprise" for
OL,22,Fthe neighbourhood or capital.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
